IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.googlemail.com
User roifewu@gmail.com
PassCmd "gpg --batch -d ~/.authinfo.gpg 2>/dev/null | awk '$2==\"imap.gmail.com\"{for(i=3;i<NF;i+=2)if($i==\"password\"){print $(i+1);exit}}'"
AuthMechs LOGIN
TLSType IMAPS
TLSVersions -1.3

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/.local/share/mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/gmail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim
Flatten .

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Pattern INBOX *
Create Both
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *
